{
  "format_version": 1,
  "name": "r/bodyweightfitness Recommended Routine",
  "origin": "r/bodyweightfitness community wiki",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://redditbwf.github.io/",
    "method_url": "https://antranik.org/rr/",
    "note": "Structure only: which movement patterns, how the exercise ladder steps, when to move up. Written in our own words from the cited pages, no text reproduced. A training method is not copyrightable expression (17 U.S.C. 102(b), research/16 'The licence rule')."
  },
  "progression_unit": "session",
  "dose": "sets",
  "days": 3,
  "notes": "Same full-body session run 3x a week (commonly Mon/Wed/Fri), not an A/B split, so the rotation is one node that repeats and wraps its cycle count. Each movement pattern is a stages ladder: complete the top of the rep range for all sets and the next stage swaps in a harder exercise.",
  "rotation": [
    {
      "id": "A",
      "label": "Full Body",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "label": "Pull",
          "exercise": "Ring_Row",
          "sets": 3,
          "rep_range": [8, 12],
          "stages": [
            {"exercise": "Ring_Row", "rep_range": [8, 12]},
            {"exercise": "Negative_Pull-Up", "rep_range": [5, 8]},
            {"exercise": "Pullups", "rep_range": [5, 8]},
            {"exercise": "Archer_Pull-Up", "rep_range": [3, 5]}
          ],
          "progression": {
            "axis": "level",
            "increment": 1,
            "increment_unit": "levels",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "top_of_rep_range"},
            "on_miss": "hold"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Push",
          "exercise": "Incline_Push-Up",
          "sets": 3,
          "rep_range": [8, 12],
          "stages": [
            {"exercise": "Incline_Push-Up", "rep_range": [8, 12]},
            {"exercise": "Pushups", "rep_range": [8, 12]},
            {"exercise": "Diamond_Push-Up", "rep_range": [6, 10]},
            {"exercise": "Ring_Dips", "rep_range": [5, 8]}
          ],
          "progression": {
            "axis": "level",
            "increment": 1,
            "increment_unit": "levels",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "top_of_rep_range"},
            "on_miss": "hold"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Squat",
          "exercise": "Chair_Squat",
          "sets": 3,
          "rep_range": [8, 12],
          "stages": [
            {"exercise": "Chair_Squat", "rep_range": [8, 12]},
            {"exercise": "Bodyweight_Squat", "rep_range": [8, 12]},
            {"exercise": "Pistol_Squat", "rep_range": [5, 8]}
          ],
          "progression": {
            "axis": "level",
            "increment": 1,
            "increment_unit": "levels",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "top_of_rep_range"},
            "on_miss": "hold"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Core",
          "exercise": "Plank",
          "sets": 3,
          "duration_s": 30,
          "stages": [
            {"exercise": "Plank", "duration_s": 30},
            {"exercise": "Side_Bridge", "duration_s": 30},
            {"exercise": "Hanging_Leg_Raise", "rep_range": [8, 12]}
          ],
          "progression": {
            "axis": "level",
            "increment": 1,
            "increment_unit": "levels",
            "advance_when": {"kind": "sessions_at_stage", "count": 6},
            "on_miss": "hold"
          },
          "note": "Time-held stages advance on a session count, not top_of_rep_range: the last stage swaps to reps and mixing rep_range and duration_s advance criteria in one advance_when is not expressible."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
